1
00:00:03,370 --> 00:00:05,410
(Penny:)-Hey, can I ask you a question?
-Sure.

2
00:00:05,572 --> 00:00:06,712
(Penny:)You've had this dart board
since I've known you.

3
00:00:06,840 --> 00:00:07,980
(Penny:)But I've never seen you play.

4
00:00:08,208 --> 00:00:10,418
Oh, we played... once.

5
00:00:10,577 --> 00:00:12,317
(Leonard:)I broke a window.

6
00:00:12,479 --> 00:00:13,519
(Penny:)What window?

7
00:00:13,680 --> 00:00:15,250
(Leonard:)That one over there.

8
00:00:16,583 --> 00:00:18,823
(Sheldon:)Leonard,
where are the Skee-Ball tickets?

9
00:00:18,986 --> 00:00:20,156
(Sheldon:)Skee-Ball tickets?

10
00:00:20,320 --> 00:00:22,560
(Sheldon:)Yeah, from when we went
to the arcade three years ago?

11
00:00:22,723 --> 00:00:24,433
(Sheldon:)I finally decided what prize I want.

12
00:00:26,693 --> 00:00:27,733
(Sheldon:)Hurry up.

13
00:00:29,162 --> 00:00:32,442
(Leonard:)If I still have them,
they're probably in the junk box.

14
00:00:32,599 --> 00:00:35,099
(Penny:)-Ooh, what are you gonna get?
-None of your business.

15
00:00:35,269 --> 00:00:38,619
(Sheldon:)But when you see me wearing
a flower in my lapel later,

16
00:00:38,772 --> 00:00:40,752
(Sheldon:)you are most welcome to sniff it.

17
00:00:42,776 --> 00:00:45,446
-Yup, got 'em, here you go.
-Oh, thank you.

18
00:00:45,612 --> 00:00:48,392
(Sheldon:)Here, get yourself an eraser
for your troubles.

19
00:00:51,685 --> 00:00:53,355
(Leonard:)Oh, I forgot about this.

20
00:00:53,921 --> 00:00:56,231
(Leonard:)My aunt made it for me
when I started college.

21
00:00:59,259 --> 00:01:02,019
(Penny:)Aw, did she hate you?

